        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Randy Savage, Randy Mario Poffo\n- Organizations: World Wrestling Federation (WWF/WWE), World Championship Wrestling (WCW)\n- Roles: professional wrestler, color commentator\n- Places: Atlanta, Georgia\n\nFacts:\n- Randy Mario Poffo was born on November 15, 1952, and died on May 20, 2011.\n- Randy Mario Poffo was better known by the ring name \"Macho Man\" Randy Savage.\n- Randy Savage was an American professional wrestler and color commentator.\n- Randy Savage was best known for his time in the World Wrestling Federation, now called WWE, and later in World Championship Wrestling.\n- World Championship Wrestling, Inc. was an American professional wrestling promotion.\n- World Championship Wrestling was historically based in Atlanta, Georgia.",
